I ascended the Tourist I started over the Christmas holidays.  Now I've
ascended a Barbarian, Wizard, Knight and Tourist in that order.

It was a very fun game in the early going.  I was constantly running
and using everything I could to stay alive.  Finally I got up to like
experience level 10 and collected some daggers and was starting to be
able to really defend myself.  Somewhere along there I found a wand of
wishing.  That made the rest all too easy.  I used like 6 wishes but
had a bunch left over I didn't really need.

So, I'm thinking I want to try one with some conducts.  This game was
totally not with conducts.  I wished, genocided and polypiled all that
I wanted to.

Maybe someone can give me their opinion.  What would be a good
character class to start doing conducts on?  I'm thinking wishless,
genoless and polypile-less.

I'm thinking of trying Valkyries since they are supposed to be the
easiest to ascend without doing conducts.

